{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Everything is a fun and relaxing puzzle game that lets you piece together beautiful built-in images, or create custom puzzles from your own photos! Whether you're solving stunning landscapes, cute animals, or your favorite memories, Puzzle Everything offers endless possibilities for puzzle lovers of all ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to add your own images and turn them into a puzzle. <br>If it's a .bmp / .jpg / .png in 16:9 (best result) or 16:10 format it can be added.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A drop down window to temporarily store puzzle pieces that are in your way. This gives you more space on the board and will make it easier to find that one piece you were looking for. <br>It can also be used as a strategy to solve a  more difficult puzzle by storing a certain type of piece.  <br>For example: Store all pieces containing the sky in a landscape puzzle so you can focus on the landscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Difficulty presets ranging from 16 pieces to 300 pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of 11 Build in puzzles: landscapes, animals, drawings for kids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Type of puzzle: Rectangle puzzle pieces (see early access for more info)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Mode: Relaxed (see early access for more info)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933530?t=1760435504","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933530?t=1760435504","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933530/5b0ca55c7e806d606a5138553603425ce4cce7ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760435504","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933530/5b0ca55c7e806d606a5138553603425ce4cce7ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760435504","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Everything is a fun and relaxing puzzle game that lets you piece together beautiful built-in images, or create custom puzzles from your own photos! Whether you're solving stunning landscapes, cute animals, or your favorite memories, Puzzle Everything offers endless possibilities for puzzle lovers of all ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to add your own images and turn them into a puzzle. <br>If it's a .bmp / .jpg / .png in 16:9 (best result) or 16:10 format it can be added.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A drop down window to temporarily store puzzle pieces that are in your way. This gives you more space on the board and will make it easier to find that one piece you were looking for. <br>It can also be used as a strategy to solve a  more difficult puzzle by storing a certain type of piece.  <br>For example: Store all pieces containing the sky in a landscape puzzle so you can focus on the landscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Difficulty presets ranging from 16 pieces to 300 pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of 11 Build in puzzles: landscapes, animals, drawings for kids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Type of puzzle: Rectangle puzzle pieces (see early access for more info)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Mode: Relaxed (see early access for more info)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Greystone Gaming"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933530/25ba8332be8cb43c7c5e6cfa7297755034c0d9f0/header.jpg?t=1760435504","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></u